00:08:27,980 --> 00:08:32,540
Hello, everyone. Welcome to today's Cooking Husbands.

46
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:36,040
Can husbands do well in the kitchen, too?

47
00:08:36,620 --> 00:08:37,960
Of course we can.

48
00:08:38,700 --> 00:08:42,220
Today's special for our lovely husbands is a soup.

49
00:08:42,220 --> 00:08:46,160
Before we start, get the following ready.

50
00:08:46,680 --> 00:08:53,800
4 carrots, half cabbage, half a bottle tomato sauce, and half a kilo of beef.

51
00:08:54,660 --> 00:08:57,440
First, cut the materials in pieces.

52
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:02,620
Next, put them all in the pot and cook for about 20 minutes.

53
00:09:03,180 --> 00:09:07,620
Then, put in the tomato sauce and cook for another 10 minutes.

54
00:09:07,620 --> 00:09:12,800
Finally, add a teaspoon of salt before you turn off the gas.

55
00:09:13,460 --> 00:09:15,540
Have a taste of this lovely soup.

56
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:20,620
This can be the most delicious home cooking you have ever done.

